• Revision checklist — I can narrate the adrenal from the inside out: medulla catecholamines and the emergency list, then cortex zones G, F, R with aldosterone, cortisol and androgens, plus Addison's disease as cortical underproduction.
• Revision checklist — I can work the glucose seesaw: alpha-glucagon raises, beta-insulin lowers, and separate diabetes mellitus from diabetes insipidus on hormone, gland and urine glucose.
